{"id":"n16288-1-7","stage":3,"title":"끝없이 · 无边无际地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16288-1-7-1","ko":"김 선생님은 참 존경받는 분이셔요.","zh":"金老师真是一位备受尊敬的人啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）。","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"선생님은","meaning":"先生","explanation":"선생님：先生；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"2","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님은","audio":"/audio/c7ef4222518a3b7c537d.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"존경받는","meaning":"尊敬；接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"존경：尊敬；받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"존경","audio":"/audio/a672d03a428717415bf3.mp3"},{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76215","senseId":"1","lemma":"존경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"존경받는","audio":"/audio/e76c5d678b84e12ee784.mp3"}},{"text":"분이셔요.","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분이셔요","audio":"/audio/d7b3cf43290bbc5670bd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"先生","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"加在某人的姓氏或职业之后，以表示对其的尊敬。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"a672d03a42871741","term":"존경","zh":"尊敬","audio":"/audio/a672d03a428717415bf3.mp3","entryId":"76215","definition":"对某人的高尚人格或行为尊崇敬重。","pronunciation":["존경"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]}],"audio":"/audio/c3b46bb835d31ba4fcb6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16288-1-7-2","ko":"그래서 제자들이 늘 끝없이 찾아오더라고요.","zh":"所以他的学生们总是不停地来找他。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以。","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"제자들이","meaning":"弟子","explanation":"제자：弟子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"제자","audio":"/audio/e44aa157cce58cdc09c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31804","senseId":"1","lemma":"제자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제자들이","audio":"/audio/72c469f8a7bc36538b79.mp3"}},{"text":"늘","meaning":"总，老，老是，经常","explanation":"늘：总，老，老是，经常。","readings":[{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40481","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}},{"text":"끝없이","meaning":"无边无际地，无止境地","explanation":"끝없이：无边无际地，无止境地。","readings":[{"term":"끝없이","audio":"/audio/8cc991aea88f9614cd3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16288","s